      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.74,
          "en": "So, let's now work on that AuthPage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.74,
          "end": 8.14,
          "en": "and make sure that when we log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.14,
          "end": 10.43,
          "en": "so here in the auth-form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.43,
          "end": 15.43,
          "en": "that if we called signIn and we did sign in successfully",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.53,
          "end": 18.87,
          "en": "that we then redirect and that if we load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.87,
          "end": 21.59,
          "en": "even though we are logged in already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.59,
          "end": 24.43,
          "en": "we also maybe navigate away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.43,
          "end": 26.17,
          "en": "Now let's start with the redirecting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.17,
          "end": 28.84,
          "en": "after logging in successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.84,
          "end": 31.39,
          "en": "We can simply do this here in this, if ($check).",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.39,
          "end": 34.09,
          "en": "Here, we check if we don't have an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.09,
          "end": 36.41,
          "en": "So, if signing in succeeded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.41,
          "end": 38.93,
          "en": "and that is when we want to redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.93,
          "end": 42.33,
          "en": "Now we could again redirect with window.location.ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.33,
          "end": 46.49,
          "en": "but that basically resets the entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.49,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "That is fine for an initial page load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "but if we already worked in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 55.66,
          "en": "and we have two single-page application already going on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.66,
          "end": 59.23,
          "en": "then we probably don't wanna reset the entire application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.23,
          "end": 61.73,
          "en": "and lose all our state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.73,
          "end": 63.12,
          "en": "Even though in this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.12,
          "end": 64.22,
          "en": "we wouldn't lose much,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.22,
          "end": 68.31,
          "en": "but of course that's not necessarily the case for every app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "So therefore, instead here for redirecting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.77,
          "end": 74.593,
          "en": "the better way of doing that is by using the Next router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 79.46000000000001,
          "en": "So we can import from 'next/router,'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.923,
          "en": "and from there we can import the useRouter hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.81,
          "end": 85.97,
          "en": "And then in our component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.97,
          "end": 90.97,
          "en": "we simply call useRouter here to get access to that router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.14,
          "end": 93.43,
          "en": "We already were with the router earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.43,
          "end": 94.61,
          "en": "in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.61,
          "end": 96.65,
          "en": "Now we work with it again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.65,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "And once we got access to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 102.47,
          "en": "here, we can simply call replace.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.47,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "And replace will basically redirect us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 108.83,
          "en": "It will replace the current URL with a different one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.83,
          "end": 112.173,
          "en": "And we can for example go to ('/profile') here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.28,
          "end": 114.49000000000001,
          "en": "And if we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.49000000000001,
          "end": 116.3,
          "en": "if we implement this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.3,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "now, if I go back and I do log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.833,
          "en": "with valid credentials here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.13,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "After logging in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 128.45,
          "en": "I'm redirected to that profile page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.45,
          "end": 130.27,
          "en": "Of course, on the login page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.27,
          "end": 131.97,
          "en": "we could show some loading state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.97,
          "end": 135.38,
          "en": "whilst this log in request is on its way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.38,
          "end": 138.89,
          "en": "but that is some UI feedback which you of course can add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.89,
          "end": 141.09,
          "en": "The core functionality works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.09,
          "end": 142.98,
          "en": "Now, I just want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.98,
          "end": 147.86,
          "en": "that I can't visit this AuthPage if I am logged in already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.86,
          "end": 149.61,
          "en": "And we could again implement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 152.22,
          "en": "this with getService side props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.22,
          "end": 154.53,
          "en": "to check the authentication status,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 157.24,
          "en": "when a request reaches that route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.24,
          "end": 161.24,
          "en": "Alternatively, we implement our client's side work around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.24,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "And I'll do that here just to practice this again.",
