          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.67,
          "end": 321.44,
          "en": "So that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 321.44,
          "end": 326.34,
          "en": "And with that, we now also protect our AuthPage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 326.34,
          "end": 328.35,
          "en": "and the profile page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 328.35,
          "end": 330.01,
          "en": "And we make sure that depending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
